&lt;h2&gt;


  Why I built it
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;While searching for internships, I realized I had to visit multiple websites every day—LinkedIn, Wellfound, Indeed, Cutshort, Instahyre, and others. It was repetitive and time-consuming.&lt;br&gt;
So I decided to build a platform that brings jobs from multiple sources into a single interface.&lt;/p&gt;

